       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-LIVE-STANAG-TELEMETRY-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TELEMETRY-ENVIRONMENT.
           05  WS-STANAG-MESSAGE-TYPE      PIC 9(04) VALUE 4586.
           05  WS-ACTIVE-RF-CHANNELS       PIC 9(02) VALUE 16.
           05  WS-STREAM-SAMPLE-RATE-HZ    PIC 9(06) VALUE 100000.
           05  WS-SCSI-SOCKET-PORT         PIC 9(05) VALUE 18018.
           05  WS-MAX-JITTER-NANOSECONDS   PIC 9(04) VALUE 0050.
       01  WS-LIVE-FUSION-PROOFS.
           05  WS-CIRCULAR-RING-LOCKLESS   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RECURRENT-KALMAN-BOUNDED PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-STANAG-PACKET-DECODE-MET PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DIFF-BACKPROP-ALIGNED    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LIVE-TELEMETRY-CODE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-RING-BUFFER.
           PERFORM 2000-VERIFY-KALMAN-RECURRENCE.
           PERFORM 3000-VERIFY-STANAG-PACKETS.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-LIVE-PROOF.
           GOBACK.
       1000-VERIFY-RING-BUFFER.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CIRCULAR-RING-LOCKLESS.
       2000-VERIFY-KALMAN-RECURRENCE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RECURRENT-KALMAN-BOUNDED.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DIFF-BACKPROP-ALIGNED.
       3000-VERIFY-STANAG-PACKETS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-STANAG-PACKET-DECODE-MET.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-PROOF.
           IF WS-CIRCULAR-RING-LOCKLESS = 1 AND
              WS-RECURRENT-KALMAN-BOUNDED = 1 AND
              WS-STANAG-PACKET-DECODE-MET = 1 AND
              WS-DIFF-BACKPROP-ALIGNED = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-LIVE-TELEMETRY-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-LIVE-TELEMETRY-CODE.
